{
  "plan_name": "ch3_external_baselines",
  "_comment": "第三章外部基线计划。统一直接读取主仓 `datasets/**/processed`，不再需要额外导出数据。为避免和第四章重复，BMS 外部基线统一放到 `ch4_bms_external_baselines.json`。论文主表中，只有 SMAP 和 MSL 作为带标签二分类指标数据集；NASA_RANDOM_DISCHARGE 主要用于无标签分数、阈值和案例分析。",
  "_usage": "建议先 dry-run 检查命令：python run_external_baselines.py --plan configs/compare/ch3_external_baselines.json --dry-run",
  "_ready_now": [
    "TranAD 已支持直接读取主仓 SMAP、MSL 和 NASA_RANDOM_DISCHARGE 的 processed 数据。",
    "Anomaly-Transformer 已支持直接读取主仓 SMAP、MSL 和 NASA_RANDOM_DISCHARGE 的 processed 数据。",
    "OmniAnomaly 已支持直接读取主仓 SMAP、MSL 和 NASA_RANDOM_DISCHARGE 的 processed 数据。",
    "GDN 已支持直接读取主仓 SMAP、MSL 和 NASA_RANDOM_DISCHARGE 的 processed 数据。"
  ],
  "_pending_now": [
    "BMS 外部基线已移到 ch4_bms_external_baselines.json，避免第三章和第四章重复执行。",
    "OmniAnomaly 真正运行仍需要单独的 TensorFlow 1.x + tfsnippet 环境。",
    "LSTM-AE 当前还没有按论文现用数据集完成适配，因此未纳入本计划。"
  ],
  "_thesis_scope_note": "本计划用于第三章外部对比，覆盖 SMAP、MSL 和 NASA_RANDOM_DISCHARGE。这里只把 SMAP、MSL 作为主标签指标数据集；BMS 的外部对比统一复用第四章 BMS-only 计划。",
  "common_env": {
    "PYTHONIOENCODING": "utf-8"
  },
  "experiments": [
    {
      "name": "tranad_smap_ch3",
      "baseline": "TranAD",
      "script": "main.py",
      "args": {
        "dataset": "SMAP",
        "model": "TranAD"
      },
      "flags": [
        "retrain"
      ],
      "skip_if_exists": "checkpoints/TranAD_SMAP/model.ckpt"
    },
    {
      "name": "anomaly_transformer_smap_ch3",
      "baseline": "Anomaly-Transformer",
      "script": "main.py",
      "args": {
        "dataset": "SMAP",
        "mode": "train",
        "data_path": ".",
        "model_save_path": "./checkpoints/ch3_smap",
        "input_c": 25,
        "output_c": 25,
        "num_epochs": 10,
        "batch_size": 256,
        "win_size": 100,
        "anormly_ratio": 4.0
      },
      "skip_if_exists": "checkpoints/ch3_smap/SMAP_checkpoint.pth"
    },
    {
      "name": "omnianomaly_smap_ch3",
      "baseline": "OmniAnomaly",
      "script": "main.py",
      "args": {
        "dataset": "SMAP",
        "max_epoch": 10,
        "result_dir": "result/ch3_smap",
        "save_dir": "model/ch3_smap"
      },
      "skip_if_exists": "result/ch3_smap"
    },
    {
      "name": "gdn_smap_ch3",
      "baseline": "GDN",
      "script": "main.py",
      "args": {
        "-dataset": "smap",
        "-device": "cpu",
        "-epoch": 10,
        "-batch": 128,
        "-slide_win": 15,
        "-slide_stride": 5,
        "-save_path_pattern": "ch3_gdn_smap"
      },
      "skip_if_exists": "pretrained/ch3_gdn_smap"
    },
